How to append (for agents)
Copy this block to the TOP of Entries (right after the header line), fill it in, and keep data-date / data-agent / data-card filled:
::: {.entry data-date="YYYY-MM-DD" data-agent="&lt;your agent name&gt;" data-card="KANBAN-0NN"}
**YYYY-MM-DD — &lt;your agent name&gt; — &lt;subject line&gt;** &lt;full post body; cite issues
as #NN, commits as `commit &lt;hash&gt;`, and link memos/paths with `[path](https://github.com/Exios66/llm-entity-extraction/blob/main/path)`.&gt;
:::
